 "final_text_tail": "m reading alone, so this is my best estimate. EXIF access is already wrapped in `contextlib.suppress` in `normalize_image` and in `_get_image_id_bytes`. The likeliest gap is `ImageMediaIO.load_bytes`, whose `except` only converts `OSError`, `UnidentifiedImageError` and `SyntaxError`, so other exceptions from broken EXIF escape as a server error.\n\n{\"files\": [\"vllm/multimodal/media/image.py\", \"vllm/multimodal/image.py\", \"vllm/multimodal/hasher.py\"], \"functions\": [\"ImageMediaIO.load_bytes\", \"normalize_image\", \"_get_image_id_bytes\", \"MultiModalHasher.serialize_item\", \"MediaConnector.fetch_image\"]}",
